    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tactical Overview, Total Control</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3662590/extras/9e64318b81982a750bedcf481480d75d.poster.avif?t=1750125495\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3662590/extras/9e64318b81982a750bedcf481480d75d.webm?t=1750125495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3662590/extras/9e64318b81982a750bedcf481480d75d.mp4?t=1750125495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Top-down third-person shooter with a wide battlefield perspective for precise tactical planning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Full Arsenal, Free Switching</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3662590/extras/17657e9f5171eb321839a7a73d9a1533.poster.avif?t=1750125495\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3662590/extras/17657e9f5171eb321839a7a73d9a1533.webm?t=1750125495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3662590/extras/17657e9f5171eb321839a7a73d9a1533.mp4?t=1750125495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seamlessly switch between silenced pistols and heavy firepower to adapt to any combat scenario</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unrestricted Exploration, Living World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3662590/extras/7439b943323c952814428b2c05f4da53.poster.avif?t=1750125495\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3662590/extras/7439b943323c952814428b2c05f4da53.webm?t=1750125495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3662590/extras/7439b943323c952814428b2c05f4da53.mp4?t=1750125495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Highly interactive maps\u2014every building and room is accessible, hiding secrets and dynamic events.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Branching Stories, Your Choices Matter</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3662590/extras/054d92b2b56de38fa6096af2d05921ce.poster.avif?t=1750125495\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3662590/extras/054d92b2b56de38fa6096af2d05921ce.webm?t=1750125495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3662590/extras/054d92b2b56de38fa6096af2d05921ce.mp4?t=1750125495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multi-path narrative system where every decision alters the story, leading to vastly different endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fast-Paced Combat, Adrenaline Rush</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3662590/extras/e7672b827e620b6f195e524abf85edf6.poster.avif?t=1750125495\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3662590/extras/e7672b827e620b6f195e524abf85edf6.webm?t=1750125495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3662590/extras/e7672b827e620b6f195e524abf85edf6.mp4?t=1750125495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tightly designed missions** blending stealth, gunfights, and chases\u2014non-stop action from start to finish!  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>***Please add to your wishlist</strong>***</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
